{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Adventures of TED and the Lost Magic Crystals</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Adventures of TED and the Lost Magic Crystals</i> is a cozy 2.5D platformer adventure game. Play as young TED on his quest to find the lost magic crystals, which are essential for the survival of the Squirrel Kingdom.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461490/extras/20f2d8fe0954b00bf82346570af85208.poster.avif?t=1763025151\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461490/extras/20f2d8fe0954b00bf82346570af85208.webm?t=1763025151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461490/extras/20f2d8fe0954b00bf82346570af85208.mp4?t=1763025151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Features:</u> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >31 challenging levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic and action-packed sequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden items and secrets to discover and collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic battles against giant bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support (Xbox &amp; PlayStation)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461490/extras/2b36ab3378b92b713b2a42a5dcca29a8.poster.avif?t=1763025151\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461490/extras/2b36ab3378b92b71